<title>POLAND: Budimex signs PLN 68 mln German deals.</title>
<headline>Budimex signs PLN 68 mln German deals.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Budimex SA has signed 45 contracts in Germany in the first quarter of 1997, which totalled 68 million zlotys, Budimex said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It gave no further details on the contracts.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
